WEBVTT

00:06.047 --> 00:07.924
Hurry up!

00:08.008 --> 00:08.883
Yes, sir!

00:10.510 --> 00:13.555
If we don't hurry,
someone else will beat us to it!

00:13.638 --> 00:14.806
Yes, sir!

00:15.390 --> 00:18.101
The reward is huge this time.

00:18.184 --> 00:19.602
Get your act together...

00:21.479 --> 00:22.313
What?

00:27.027 --> 00:28.028
Over there!

00:28.111 --> 00:29.612
Kill him!

00:33.450 --> 00:35.410
Looks like this is going
to cause quite a stir.

00:37.579 --> 00:38.830
I can't believe it.

00:39.998 --> 00:42.542
They're taking such drastic measures.

00:44.002 --> 00:44.919
Brother...

00:45.003 --> 00:48.506
Wouldn't it be better to leave
through the underground passage?

00:48.590 --> 00:52.260
No, it's faster to escape
through the streets during the chaos.

00:52.927 --> 00:55.221
You've gathered all our forces, right?

00:55.930 --> 00:57.432
I've already made arrangements.

00:57.515 --> 01:01.770
Shiji Bau also reported
that she's hired the Iron Whale.

01:01.853 --> 01:03.229
The Iron Whale, huh?

01:04.355 --> 01:06.983
I wonder if they'll make it in time.

01:07.525 --> 01:10.737
Let the adventurers who are still able
to move deal with the intruders.

01:11.821 --> 01:13.615
Xylo Forbartz.

01:14.365 --> 01:17.702
If it's come to this, we have no choice
but to kill the one bound to the Goddess.

01:18.328 --> 01:21.081
Iri, stay by my side.

01:21.706 --> 01:23.124
Yes, Brother.

01:23.666 --> 01:26.085
I'll protect you
even if it costs me my life.

01:26.169 --> 01:27.170
Yes...

01:27.879 --> 01:30.590
Sacrificing your lives for each other.

01:31.508 --> 01:34.511
That's what a family should be.

03:08.187 --> 03:09.272
Curse you, Xylo.

03:09.355 --> 03:12.233
Has everything so far really
been going according to his plan?

03:12.317 --> 03:15.194
We can only hope so.

03:15.820 --> 03:19.616
If that's the case,
I didn't expect him to be so violent.

03:20.199 --> 03:21.618
Let's go!

03:21.701 --> 03:23.578
Let's finish them off!

03:31.336 --> 03:32.962
Good grief...

03:33.046 --> 03:34.631
Now then, who's next?

03:35.840 --> 03:37.592
Well, that's not too bad.

03:38.301 --> 03:39.469
Hey, hey, hey!

03:39.552 --> 03:42.138
Give me a break!
I can't do business like this!

03:47.727 --> 03:48.937
Those two...

03:53.233 --> 03:54.234
Take this!

03:57.528 --> 03:58.988
What's going on?

04:06.871 --> 04:08.748
- No way...
- My shop...

04:09.916 --> 04:12.043
Hey, control your firepower!

04:12.126 --> 04:13.962
It's to cut off the reinforcements.

04:18.633 --> 04:19.884
Children?

04:22.053 --> 04:23.137
What should we do?

04:24.138 --> 04:26.224
How many are there? Damn it...

04:27.934 --> 04:31.271
As long as you watch out
for the children attacking from below,

04:31.354 --> 04:32.313
they're no real threat.

04:32.397 --> 04:34.315
I know, but...

04:35.233 --> 04:36.359
Too slow!

04:43.074 --> 04:45.201
The seal of violet lightning, Gwemel?

04:45.285 --> 04:48.746
Do you understand how to fight now,
Lady Holy Knight?

04:49.414 --> 04:51.708
Xylo, what's our next move?

04:51.791 --> 04:56.796
I hope there's something
more than fruit in that head of yours.

04:57.422 --> 04:59.674
I'm going to make a bigger ruckus.

04:59.757 --> 05:02.927
If that happens, Lideo Sodrick
won't be able to stand by and watch.

05:04.804 --> 05:07.765
You're no smarter than a piece of fruit.

05:07.849 --> 05:10.393
- There's no plan more sloppy than this--
- That's enough!

05:15.189 --> 05:19.360
So you're the ones
who disturbed the peace of the town?

05:20.987 --> 05:22.864
You'd better prepare yourselves!

05:23.740 --> 05:25.825
Who are those people?

05:25.908 --> 05:28.828
Are they the ones maintaining
the peace of the town?

05:28.911 --> 05:29.996
It seems so.

05:31.122 --> 05:33.458
It looks like you don't know who we are.

05:33.541 --> 05:37.003
We're top-ranked members
of the Ioff Adventurers Guild,

05:37.086 --> 05:41.090
the Giant-Hunter Brigade,
bringing bloodshed wherever we go.

05:41.174 --> 05:42.425
Never heard of you.

05:43.968 --> 05:46.721
You bastards! I won't forgive you!

05:46.804 --> 05:47.847
Lightning staff!

05:48.514 --> 05:50.266
Fire!

05:53.061 --> 05:54.896
Idiots! Where are you shooting?

05:55.480 --> 05:56.606
What's going on?

05:57.273 --> 05:59.150
What a farce.

06:00.359 --> 06:01.652
Fire...!

06:01.736 --> 06:04.322
If you hit them,
I'll reward you handsomely!

06:05.073 --> 06:07.075
It's not powerful, and it lacks accuracy.

06:07.158 --> 06:09.202
It's just something
to liven up a festival.

06:12.330 --> 06:13.998
- I'll leave this to you.
- Wait!

06:14.082 --> 06:16.209
Don't dump these weirdos on us!

06:22.006 --> 06:23.883
Eat this!

06:48.366 --> 06:53.913
Attacking Xylo or me means
declaring war on the Mastibolt family.

06:53.996 --> 06:55.248
You will regret this.

06:55.331 --> 06:57.500
If you really care about this town,

06:57.583 --> 07:00.294
stop this nonsense
and do your job properly.

07:01.671 --> 07:03.422
You two get along surprisingly well.

07:11.597 --> 07:12.765
A troll!

07:12.849 --> 07:15.601
Does Sodrick keep faeries as pets?

07:16.185 --> 07:17.478
Well, at least

07:17.562 --> 07:20.440
it's not some badly trained pet.

07:38.249 --> 07:42.128
We have the upper hand.
That's it! Drive them into a corner!

07:43.045 --> 07:44.088
Go!

07:45.465 --> 07:46.799
If you want to fight...

07:49.177 --> 07:50.094
Ah... damn it!

07:52.972 --> 07:56.017
It seems you still need my protection.

07:57.101 --> 08:01.481
My knight, the sorry state you are in
is your punishment for abandoning me.

08:01.564 --> 08:02.940
However,

08:03.024 --> 08:06.444
I, the great goddess,
shall graciously save you!

08:06.527 --> 08:09.113
All right, everyone! It is time!

08:09.197 --> 08:11.407
- All right. Move out!
- I have to apologize to Siena

08:11.491 --> 08:12.825
and Zofflec later...

08:13.451 --> 08:15.077
Who are they?

08:15.620 --> 08:17.538
I advise you to listen to me.

08:17.622 --> 08:20.791
You'd better leave now or surrender.

08:21.417 --> 08:23.002
Otherwise, people will die.

08:29.175 --> 08:31.093
Brother, this way.

08:31.886 --> 08:34.222
I won't let him provoke me.

08:34.305 --> 08:37.183
Right now, the most important thing
is not to let him know where I am.

08:38.643 --> 08:40.561
I am Norgalle Senridge

08:40.645 --> 08:44.607
of the United Kingdom
of Zef-Zeyal Meht Kioh.

08:44.690 --> 08:45.733
My loyal subjects--

08:45.816 --> 08:47.151
- Shut up!
- Who the heck are you?

08:47.235 --> 08:48.069
I'll kill you, you know!

08:48.152 --> 08:49.612
- Come down!
- Get lost!

08:49.695 --> 08:50.988
Die!

08:52.698 --> 08:54.075
Unfortunately,

08:54.158 --> 08:57.828
I never thought
I'd have to resort to vigilantism.

08:59.038 --> 09:04.794
For the crime of treason, you're hereby
sentenced to be executed by explosion.

09:10.716 --> 09:12.093
Damn it! Attack!

09:29.485 --> 09:31.404
Charge!

09:32.947 --> 09:34.782
Cavalry, huh...

09:34.865 --> 09:36.534
What a pain in the ass.

09:38.160 --> 09:39.328
Take this.

09:43.082 --> 09:44.500
- What's going on?
- Damn it!

09:44.584 --> 09:45.876
Go around!

09:48.045 --> 09:49.714
Brace yourselves!

09:49.797 --> 09:50.965
Take that!

10:04.895 --> 10:07.940
I feel sorry for the horses
that got dragged into this.

10:08.024 --> 10:09.233
Alright, hurry and escape.

10:15.239 --> 10:16.449
For real?

10:24.915 --> 10:26.000
Xylo, go!

10:26.083 --> 10:27.501
We'll hold it back.

10:29.795 --> 10:30.838
Teoritta!

10:32.006 --> 10:33.424
My knight!

10:33.966 --> 10:36.636
Lend me your strength and defeat them!

10:37.511 --> 10:41.182
Have you realized just how important
a dependable goddess like me is?

10:41.265 --> 10:43.392
Yes, that's absolutely right!

10:45.436 --> 10:47.063
Commander, this way!

10:47.146 --> 10:48.314
Rajit!

10:48.397 --> 10:51.275
Can you do it, Xylo Forbartz?

10:52.485 --> 10:53.486
Let's go!

10:53.569 --> 10:54.612
Very well!

10:56.030 --> 10:57.323
My knight!

10:57.406 --> 10:59.408
Finish it quickly!

11:07.625 --> 11:09.627
Take this!

11:21.389 --> 11:22.264
I'm sorry.

11:22.973 --> 11:24.141
You saved me.

11:25.226 --> 11:26.936
Is that all?

11:27.019 --> 11:29.563
Are you not forgetting
the most important part, the praise?

11:33.067 --> 11:37.571
I want to receive praise
from my knight personally.

11:37.655 --> 11:42.118
Xylo, I want to hear you say,
"You are truly amazing."

11:47.415 --> 11:49.959
You're truly an amazing goddess.

12:00.761 --> 12:03.347
What in the world is going on...?

12:03.431 --> 12:05.099
You should understand by now.

12:05.182 --> 12:08.144
If you truly wish to atone,

12:08.227 --> 12:10.563
then I shall forgive you.

12:12.940 --> 12:15.776
Who are these guys...?

12:18.154 --> 12:19.738
Don't push!

12:22.283 --> 12:24.201
How could this be...?

12:25.578 --> 12:28.372
The town passed down from our ancestors...

12:30.541 --> 12:32.668
Brother, don't leave me!

12:32.751 --> 12:33.627
Wait...

12:33.711 --> 12:35.796
- Brother!
- Iri!

12:35.880 --> 12:37.590
Um, I'm sorry...

12:40.134 --> 12:43.512
I really didn't want to do this...

12:43.596 --> 12:46.557
But a really nasty guy threatened me...

12:46.640 --> 12:48.809
This is the last thing I want to do...

12:49.560 --> 12:52.521
- Li--
- I'm truly sorry about this...

12:53.105 --> 12:56.150
but please, just come with me.

12:56.233 --> 12:57.818
I won't do anything to you...

13:14.960 --> 13:17.296
This is quite a mess.

13:17.838 --> 13:21.133
It seems things have gotten
quite troublesome.

13:21.217 --> 13:24.053
Lideo Sodrick
might already be dead, you know.

13:24.136 --> 13:25.846
Gosh, this is too much.

13:27.139 --> 13:31.560
I finally made it out,
and the client's going to die like this?

13:33.562 --> 13:36.106
No reward, no deal.

13:36.190 --> 13:37.650
I'm out.

13:39.818 --> 13:44.240
I'll collect the money
from the Adventurers Guild and leave.

13:44.323 --> 13:46.116
Boojum, what are you going to do?

13:46.700 --> 13:50.371
I'm going to save Lideo Sodrick.

13:50.454 --> 13:52.665
It's the right thing to do.

13:52.748 --> 13:53.916
Are you serious?

13:53.999 --> 13:56.544
He took care of me, after all.

13:56.627 --> 13:59.129
I don't expect you to help...

14:00.839 --> 14:02.550
No, wait a second.

14:05.261 --> 14:07.805
I see, so this is it?

14:08.597 --> 14:10.015
What a shame.

14:10.099 --> 14:11.642
What's wrong?

14:11.725 --> 14:13.227
I received an order.

14:13.310 --> 14:16.730
We'll have to cut ties with Lideo Sodrick.

14:17.439 --> 14:19.984
Your goal is money, right?

14:20.067 --> 14:22.653
Then, how about a new job?

14:23.654 --> 14:24.572
What?

14:25.322 --> 14:26.615
Who's the client?

14:27.366 --> 14:28.701
We are.

14:35.749 --> 14:36.959
These guys...

14:38.419 --> 14:39.795
Stop it.

14:40.504 --> 14:41.881
That's rude.

14:50.097 --> 14:52.099
Boojum, who exactly are you...

14:52.182 --> 14:54.226
We'll pay you.

14:54.310 --> 14:58.856
That's what makes humans work hard, right?

14:59.773 --> 15:01.817
I don't mind.

15:01.901 --> 15:05.654
As long as I get paid,
adventurers or Demon Blight,

15:05.738 --> 15:07.406
they're all good clients to me.

15:07.489 --> 15:10.868
So, what's the request, client?

15:10.951 --> 15:13.829
I'm not the client.

15:15.039 --> 15:19.960
But the order was to erase
any evidence linking us to Lideo Sodrick,

15:20.544 --> 15:22.922
literally without leaving a single trace.

15:24.423 --> 15:27.551
No problem. This is my forte.

15:27.635 --> 15:29.929
Thank you for your cooperation.

15:30.012 --> 15:32.681
Shiji Bau, what about you?

15:33.641 --> 15:36.268
You're the mentor
in charge of teaching me.

15:36.352 --> 15:37.770
I suppose I owe you one.

15:37.853 --> 15:39.605
I don't really want to kill you.

15:41.565 --> 15:45.945
You want me to betray humanity, right?

15:46.028 --> 15:48.656
Is something troubling you?

15:49.448 --> 15:53.786
Lideo Sodrick taught me
something very important.

15:54.328 --> 15:59.458
The most important thing for humans is
to protect themselves and their families.

16:00.042 --> 16:06.090
What matters most
is protecting their interests, isn't it?

16:06.173 --> 16:10.302
It's worth protecting
more than the entire race.

16:10.386 --> 16:13.889
That's what humans are, isn't it?

16:17.226 --> 16:18.143
Yeah.

16:18.852 --> 16:20.145
You're right.

16:24.191 --> 16:25.234
Keep an eye on the surroundings!

16:25.317 --> 16:27.528
You shall serve me as atonement.

16:27.611 --> 16:29.446
Give your lives in service to the people!

16:30.155 --> 16:32.491
Yes! Guys, let's go!

16:32.574 --> 16:33.409
Yes, sir!

16:36.870 --> 16:37.830
Xylo.

16:38.330 --> 16:40.833
We'll go and check the second floor.

16:40.916 --> 16:43.877
We might find some physical evidence.

16:45.170 --> 16:47.589
Now, reflect on what you have done.

16:47.673 --> 16:50.551
Repent for your crimes at once!

16:52.344 --> 16:53.554
What do you think?

16:53.637 --> 16:56.765
He seems to be in awe
of my divine majesty.

16:56.849 --> 16:57.850
Can't really tell.

16:57.933 --> 16:59.309
I am sure of it.

16:59.393 --> 17:02.021
Now, tell us everything you know.

17:02.104 --> 17:05.566
Yes. As the guild master
of the Adventurers Guild,

17:05.649 --> 17:07.901
I intended to kill you,

17:07.985 --> 17:10.446
but I know nothing about the client.

17:10.529 --> 17:13.073
Uh... that's a problem.

17:13.157 --> 17:14.825
Don't take everything so seriously.

17:18.162 --> 17:19.455
Let me tell you this.

17:19.538 --> 17:22.249
You're in a very difficult position
right now.

17:22.332 --> 17:25.627
Normally, I would just hand you
over to the Holy Knights,

17:26.295 --> 17:28.839
but I don't have to do that.

17:28.922 --> 17:31.425
Hey, don't negotiate with him on your own!

17:31.508 --> 17:34.219
Then, shall we make him confess
the easy way?

17:34.303 --> 17:37.181
I think he's used to
being treated violently.

17:39.099 --> 17:40.768
If you want to make a deal...

17:41.310 --> 17:42.686
will you accept my condition?

17:44.271 --> 17:45.981
Let's hear it.

17:47.066 --> 17:51.862
Protect my sisters and brothers.
Keep my family safe.

17:51.945 --> 17:54.573
Those creepy kids?

17:55.365 --> 17:57.826
If you promise to leave them alone,

17:58.494 --> 18:00.287
I'll consider cooperating.

18:04.833 --> 18:05.751
Got it.

18:05.834 --> 18:08.879
Xylo, you have no right to do so!

18:08.962 --> 18:11.298
Then are you going
to find them and kill them?

18:11.381 --> 18:15.302
Or are you going to bring them before him
and torture them one by one?

18:15.385 --> 18:17.221
I didn't say that.

18:17.304 --> 18:18.889
Then shut up.

18:19.473 --> 18:22.601
Lideo Sodrick, just tell me what you can.

18:22.684 --> 18:24.186
That's a good deal, don't you think?

18:26.605 --> 18:29.316
The goal is to eliminate the goddess...

18:31.110 --> 18:34.363
The client calls themselves
the coexisters.

18:34.947 --> 18:37.157
It's their names again...

18:38.117 --> 18:39.743
It happened ten days ago.

18:40.410 --> 18:43.872
At first, a man in a black mask
approached me.

18:44.456 --> 18:49.586
He said he wanted to make a deal,
but in reality, I had no choice.

18:50.254 --> 18:53.882
Obey and embrace coexistence, or die.

18:55.843 --> 19:00.264
After that, I made contact
with the brokers three times.

19:00.848 --> 19:02.891
They're everywhere.

19:04.017 --> 19:07.354
If I don't want to die,
I have to show them results.

19:08.564 --> 19:12.317
So you're betraying humanity
because you're afraid of dying?

19:12.401 --> 19:14.695
You have the power
to fight back, don't you?

19:15.320 --> 19:18.907
It seems that the coexisters plan
to put the Demon Lord in power

19:18.991 --> 19:22.035
and serve as overseers under him.

19:22.119 --> 19:24.371
Simply put, there will be slaves,

19:24.454 --> 19:26.665
the overseers of those slaves,
and a ruler.

19:27.541 --> 19:29.501
The corruption has already spread
across many regions,

19:29.585 --> 19:32.671
robbing countless people
of their lives and their land.

19:33.255 --> 19:35.215
At this rate, humanity will fall.

19:35.757 --> 19:40.470
Then I must at least secure
a position as an overseer.

19:40.554 --> 19:43.056
It's necessary for my family.

19:44.641 --> 19:46.435
I don't want to know your reasons.

19:46.518 --> 19:49.062
Give me some useful intel.

19:49.146 --> 19:50.898
Otherwise,
none of your conditions will be met.

19:53.108 --> 19:54.985
That man in the black mask...

19:55.736 --> 19:58.071
I did hear his name.

19:58.614 --> 20:01.366
Tell me, even though
I'm sure it's a fake name.

20:03.493 --> 20:05.787
Mahaeyzel Zelkoff.

20:05.871 --> 20:07.331
Don't be ridiculous.

20:07.414 --> 20:09.833
Mahaeyzel is the name of a saint.

20:09.917 --> 20:13.170
He was the leader of the Temple
during the First War of Subjugation.

20:13.795 --> 20:15.672
And that Zelkoff...

20:16.298 --> 20:18.091
That name is...

20:21.386 --> 20:22.221
Wait! Say it aga--

20:25.390 --> 20:26.642
Y-Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

20:27.434 --> 20:28.936
- What?
- Is it an attack?

20:33.315 --> 20:35.692
It's all for money.

20:35.776 --> 20:38.320
Now die quietly.

20:41.865 --> 20:43.533
Th-The building is being...

20:43.617 --> 20:44.743
Escape outside now!

20:45.994 --> 20:47.204
What's going on...

20:48.372 --> 20:49.498
Is it artillery?

20:54.086 --> 20:55.295
Xylo, hurry up!

20:55.379 --> 20:58.507
- Kivia, hurry--
- Wait! That man is...

21:00.092 --> 21:01.218
Stop!

21:01.927 --> 21:02.928
Damn it!

21:04.054 --> 21:05.681
Run! Do you want to die?

21:12.896 --> 21:14.064
It's coming again! Get down!

21:19.361 --> 21:21.488
What is this?

21:21.571 --> 21:23.699
Who would do something
like this in the street?

21:23.782 --> 21:25.033
Have they lost their minds?

21:25.117 --> 21:27.703
Damn it! If only Neely were here...

21:27.786 --> 21:30.414
Hey, don't blame Neely.

21:30.497 --> 21:31.665
I'll kill you, you know.

21:31.748 --> 21:32.874
That's not what I meant...

21:32.958 --> 21:37.879
Since the enemy has artillery,
we need Rhyno's strength.

21:37.963 --> 21:41.258
We have to find a way to get him
out of the punishment room.

21:41.341 --> 21:42.384
Huh...

21:42.467 --> 21:44.594
I don't like being with Rhyno.

21:44.678 --> 21:47.306
Kivia, let's go after Lideo Sodrick.

21:49.224 --> 21:50.350
Ah, yes...

21:50.892 --> 21:52.185
You're right...

21:55.981 --> 21:59.443
We also need to confirm
what that man said...

22:00.402 --> 22:01.945
whether it's true or false.

22:09.036 --> 22:10.245
Brother...?

22:12.539 --> 22:13.749
Iri...?

22:13.832 --> 22:15.125
Is that you, Iri?

22:15.208 --> 22:16.835
Brother!

22:17.419 --> 22:18.503
Iri!

22:19.046 --> 22:20.422
You're safe!

22:20.964 --> 22:23.300
Yes, I am. I managed to escape...

22:24.384 --> 22:27.345
I lost the guild,
but at least I'm still alive.

22:27.846 --> 22:29.765
What about the other kids?

22:30.265 --> 22:31.767
Apart from a few who were captured

22:31.850 --> 22:34.269
by the Holy Knights, the others are ahead...

22:35.020 --> 22:36.146
Thank goodness.

22:36.813 --> 22:39.858
It came at a cost,

22:39.941 --> 22:42.152
but you're all safe now.

22:42.235 --> 22:43.695
A cost...?

22:45.864 --> 22:47.157
Brother.

22:47.240 --> 22:48.950
Did you tell them something?

22:49.034 --> 22:51.578
No, I didn't say anything important.

22:52.329 --> 22:53.663
I see...

22:54.748 --> 22:55.999
Iri?

23:03.215 --> 23:06.176
Sorry, Brother. This is just a precaution.

23:12.516 --> 23:14.851
You... You're...

23:15.769 --> 23:17.437
Where's Iri...?

23:17.521 --> 23:18.814
She's dead.

23:19.439 --> 23:22.025
I borrowed her body and brain.

23:22.109 --> 23:24.111
And the other kids are over there.

23:28.448 --> 23:30.325
How... How could this be...

23:31.159 --> 23:32.244
My...

23:32.869 --> 23:36.456
My most precious... family...

23:38.458 --> 23:41.211
Goodbye, my former brother.

23:56.935 --> 24:00.188
Looks like we need to speed up the plan.

24:01.189 --> 24:03.483
Get ready to destroy this city.

24:03.567 --> 24:08.280
Annihilate all humans
and turn everything tangible to ash.

24:08.363 --> 24:14.452
Especially the Goddess Teoritta.
Kill her by any means necessary.

24:15.078 --> 24:17.873
Can you give me some time?

24:18.498 --> 24:21.585
I want to give Lideo Sodrick
a proper burial.

24:21.668 --> 24:24.212
There's no need for that.

24:24.296 --> 24:27.716
You've been placed under my command.

24:29.634 --> 24:33.096
I'm sorry, Lideo Sodrick.

24:33.180 --> 24:35.724
Thank you for buying me the book.

24:36.433 --> 24:38.226
It's not just Boojum.

24:38.310 --> 24:40.770
I need all of your help too.

24:40.854 --> 24:41.813
Of course,

24:41.897 --> 24:44.774
you'll be compensated accordingly.

24:46.109 --> 24:46.943
Okay...

24:47.527 --> 24:49.905
But there's one thing I want to know.

24:49.988 --> 24:52.490
What should we call you?

24:53.116 --> 24:54.659
Spriggan.

24:55.744 --> 24:57.245
Please call me...

24:57.996 --> 25:00.123
Spriggan.
